Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell'd we take her with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She saw our faces! We had to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setouchi says she'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's figure out what we're gonna do before she gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:21.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at where we brought her after kidnapping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what we gotta do now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you {\i1}want{\i0} to be a criminal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're already criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fuck, man. This ain't worth what Setouchi gave us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They couldn't have taken me very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think they're holding me in an abandoned warehouse by the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you guys get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:43.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was from Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:47.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An abandoned warehouse by the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we call the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to be keeping secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!\NBut we need to find where they took her first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inaban's in trouble, but I don't know what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:45.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know what I {\i0}can{\i1} do.\N{\i1}I'm just lying here, not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The ideal me would have gone to rescue her,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and a horrible person wouldn't so much as lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't decide on what to do, so I'm just lying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm doing exactly what a horrible person would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means I'm a horrible person...\N{\i1}We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's your damn life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Live it any damn way you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sure, we expected too much out of you and didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you tried way too hard to live up to our expectations and pushed yourself over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That makes you stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setouchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if it wasn't the real you, I still fell in love with you, Nagase Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I'm not perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I'm not the ideal me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He says that I'm still my own person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The point of life isn't to be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's to do what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To be who you want to be.\N{\i1}That's how I should be trying to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've had enough!\N{\i1}I'll do whatever I feel like!\N{\i1}Nagase Iori will be Nagase Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do {\i0}I{\i1} want to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:33.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll live more freely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Much more freely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setouchi's here.\NSetouchi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many are there?\NThree men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:50.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's not our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She came at us from out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't have even happened if it wasn't for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:05:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who told us to fuck up their presentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the other girls told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit trying to play innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fuck're you lookin' at?\NStop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get hurt, do you?{Awww shit}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they won't be out for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, it's o—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Put that down!\NYou could kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't move an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happens to her is on your head!\NWe understand.\NWe understand. Just calm down.{He moved!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all {\i1}her{\i0} fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was all full of herself when she asked us to wreck your presentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let her go, and we'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Looks like we've got a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't get out of it alone, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.\NWhat are you talking about, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got a bone to pick with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy of my enemy is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy of my enemy is my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.\NIori! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please...\N{\i1}Happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori-chan, you traitor!\NWhat are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Happen! Happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Happen! Happen!\N{\i1}Happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happen! Happen! Happen!\N{\i1}Please just happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:31.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Save Inaban, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:00.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:03.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never want to do something like that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never! Never, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:11.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!\NIori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just get out of here.\NYou too, Setouchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight. You like Shiroyama from the jazz band,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and it pissed you off when he confessed to Iori and she turned him down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:43.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you started bullying her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to mess up your club room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but my friends kept egging me on, and I couldn't say no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:03.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NWhat should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:11.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have something in mind.\NStand up, Setouchi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Was that too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was more like a palm strike than a slap...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a flawless straight palm strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You put your hips into it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may have given her a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hit you so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!\NI'm sorry!\NI'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:53.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too, but that hit was on behalf of everyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:57.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of this was partly my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So now, we're even.\NThink you can forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, something's been bugging me.\NYou're a good girl at heart, aren't you, Setouchi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm good at telling what people are really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you putting on the bad girl act?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the guy I used to like was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to...\N...change yourself to match him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, you look like a girl trying too hard to be someone she isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you really want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:45.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\NI want...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not very diligent, but I want to dedicate my time to a club!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to join the student council, too!\NAnd I want to ask Shiroyama-kun—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:11:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you beating yourself up just because you aren't perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did exactly what you're doing, so I shouldn't be lecturing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Setouchi-san, would you be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Your friend?!\NWe're two of a kind. We'll make good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Nagase Iori's back, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for causing you so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've lived my life under a really silly impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cared too much about the way I thought a normal person should behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I compared my actions to that idea of normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I've always perceived myself to be acting like I was someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each time my mom divorced and remarried, and I got a new dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I tried to be a good girl according to his ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I kept trying to be a good girl no matter who I was with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that wasn't how it should've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not about being normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:06.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whether I'm acting in line with common sense or not, they'll always be there to tell me that I'm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's my damn life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll live it any damn way I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, it's already morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori, does your mom know you went out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We told our parents we'd be staying at school overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I took care of that.\NI called her last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really surprised me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you asked her to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, all I could think of was how amazing you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not trying to force my own ideals on you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was putting a lot of pressure on you without even knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Either way, you were really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I know what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But asking her to be your friend was just way out of left field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No normal person would ever ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done caring about what's normal and what isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.21,0:13:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my damn life, and I'm living it any damn way I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba!{Fun time is over}\NTaichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think we were in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we were.\NAs immature as we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think so, too.\NI'm sorry I was so immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never saw the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always just imagined my ideal version of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was really happy that you fell in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My feelings for you were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:33.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there was so much I didn't know back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did so many things wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I want a reset on our relationship.\NSorry for being so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to apologize for that, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was kind of drunk with love back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This conversation is {\i1}really{\i0} embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can only have it because we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we have the phenomenon to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.69,0:15:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll never get me to be thankful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just let me say one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have something I want to say, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi?\NTaichi?!\NTaichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything ever happened to you...\NI'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The infirmary at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of those bastards hit you...\NAnd then he got away...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The school was closer than the hospital, so we carried you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I call an ambulance, just to be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:16:01.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything ever happened to you, I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if it was {\i1}my{\i0} fault...\NYou... I...\N{\i1}I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Definitely!\N{\i1}I love you!\N{\i1}I love you! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love you so much! I love you so much! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, so, so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, I do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{suki ni natte}Love me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{suki ni shite}Make love to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Go out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I look cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:31.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!\NWhat the {\i1}hell{\i0} did I just ask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...\NI think this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be best to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kept transmitting my emotions to everyone when I was feeling like total crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet you chose the worst possible emotions at the worst possible times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I?\NI can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said it was completely random, but you chose precise moments just to make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it to make me hate myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now...\NIsn't that something that you decide for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like we've reached a rather nice point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:18:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I never imagined that I would be like this with you five.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:04.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'm strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:07.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless, this is the end of the phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be going now. Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that Setouchi-san?{she was hotter before the cut}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're keeping the earrings in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan, don't you think you look cuter this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say I wasn't cute before, Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, tell me, Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:46.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that seriously you, Setouchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She definitely looks cuter like this!{Nope}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you guys know what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just say things ended on a positive note.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:18:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work, children of Class 1-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, the day of the club presentations arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our next best spot is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:17.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fancy café that's perfect for dates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have our word that your relationship is sure to flourish after just one visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:26.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As proof, two of our club members who went there have already started dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Taichi? Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, that wasn't in the script!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we {\i1}did{\i0} start going out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what we're here to present!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good job, you guys!\NAs your moderator, I'm very proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you allowed to be in here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The jazz band just finished their performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and their performance was great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm moved by the hard work both clubs put forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm touched that I'm popular enough among my students
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for them to be fighting over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, I thought maybe I could be moderator for both clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?\NYou can do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!\NI thought about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and all I really have to do is be your moderator and supervise jazz band practices in my spare time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you could've done that from the start...\Nyou should've spoke up sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You freaking retard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban, tighten that lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! I want in, too!{yeah I bet u do}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it won't be punishment anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy if you did it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did Inaba learn that technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were somehow able to ride through another phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When April rolls around, the CRC will have the same moderator and be run the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as Aoki feared, he had to take make-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because failing meant not moving on to the next grade with Kiriyama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he studied like there was no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard Kiriyama helped him study, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like they're getting closer, slowly but surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba and I have started dating.{Victory}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you wanted to choose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:37.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?\NIt just took us too many detours to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori said that, too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need you, and you need me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Inaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that! We're in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After seeing Inaba act like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase started calling her "Dereban" instead of "Inaban."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase is back to being popular again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.66,0:22:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She found a new friend in Setouchi, and they're getting along great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for the guys Setouchi asked to mess up our club room...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about those thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-san and I took {\i1}very{\i0} good care of them with my dad's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.89,0:22:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They will never try to harm you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just what did they do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm too scared to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Uwa, got a club you want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Time for new students already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'll check out the karate team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shino, let's join the cheerleading team!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's anyone weird enough to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd better start planning on how to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.75,0:23:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not really cut out for something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.75,0:23:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope I can join a club with nice people in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.75,0:23:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Joining the CRC means that there's a chance they'll be dragged into some crazy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think we need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine hasn't shown himself since the last school year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.81,0:23:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might be planning to strike when we least expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well said.\NYou can never tell what'll happen next in life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But so long as you have faith in your feet, the road you walk will be a part of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori-chan with words of wisdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.11,0:23:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!\NLet's have all the fun we can today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still have long lives ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll all have our share of hesitation and worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we'll plant our feet firmly on the road we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.17,0:23:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Connecting our hearts with the hearts of others.
